  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">All our product offerings are around helping\r\nconsumers move with the help of DIY products. Our major offering is a Vacuum\r\ncompressible Bag for Mattress with Straps (accessory) to hold the rolled\r\nmattress together</span></p><div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;\r\npadding:1.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"border:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;padding:0in;\r\nmso-padding-alt:1.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><a name=\"_Toc55521864\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">What is mattress Vacuum Bag?</span></a></h4>\r\n\r\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Vacuum Mattress Bag</span></i></b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"> is a plastic bag which is used to cover the\r\n     mattress and seal it with a zipper on one end. The bag has a valve which\r\n     fits any household vacuum hose for sucking the air out of the mattress\r\n     resulting in the compression of the mattress. This vacuum compression is\r\n     so strong that the bag is able to reduce the size of the mattress to\r\n     around 1/8<sup>th</sup> of its original thickness. It is a 2-man job to\r\n     roll the flattened-compressed mattress into a roll and wrap it with the\r\n     straps which are also provided with the bag. This vacuum bag makes it\r\n     possible to carry any mattress in the backseat of a sedan car.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">It takes around 10 to 15 mins for the mattress\r\n     to fully get compressed.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n     &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The bag is versatile and can be used with:</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"circle\">\r\n  <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Any type of mattress (Spring, memory foam) </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Any type of thickness (4 inch – 18 inch) </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n  <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Any type of vacuum machine used for household\r\n      cleaning. </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n </ul>\r\n</ul><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The primary purpose of this bag is\r\n     to help move your mattress when moving your house to new city or\r\n     apartment. </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">It can also be used to return the\r\n     mattress to the original buyer on any online ecommerce which offers free\r\n     return offer, however, people usually do not know how to return a mattress\r\n     once opened and uncompressed from its original setting. This bag can help\r\n     with that. </span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Other additional uses of this bag\r\n     are it can be used as a water-resistant and dust free storage of mattress\r\n     or any other furniture of that size.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\n     font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;\r\npadding:1.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"border:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;padding:0in;\r\nmso-padding-alt:1.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><a name=\"_Toc55521865\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">What is included with the </span></a><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">bag?<o:p></o:p></span></h4>\r\n\r\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Space saver bag\r\n     that the customer can reuse countless times.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Detailed\r\n     step-by-step instructions<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">A double zip\r\n     seals<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">2 Straps with\r\n     Twin bags and 3 Straps with Queen/King sized bag.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Bags that have a\r\n     first sealing mechanism and a second sealing mechanism (a<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">double zip seal)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                                                </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>",
